== chat
? endgame:early
- Oh, hello. Sato's told everyone you stayed. Twice. I counted. Sorry. I count things.   #funny
? endgame
- I've a list of things to show you, now there's time. It has a list inside it. Sorry.   #funny
- Ordinary days in the chart room. Ink drying, nobody talking. I'd missed them.
- The new juniors keep asking me who to ask. I've started saying your name.
? endgame tier>=friend
- I've named a rock after you. A small one. Don't tell anyone. It's a secret rock.   #warm

